  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: 'Premou,                                                                                                                                                                                
    \n\nWe have made a mistake. I stayed after hours to finish an analysis of\nthe
    Visitor, and I believe the unknown signals we recorded started\nwhen we brought
    it down here. It seems to react to water and is\ninstructed to activate as it
    touches it. Furthermore, while we have not\nfigured out what data the Visitor
    holds, we have repeatedly caught it\nemitting some sort of radio wave. I have
    reasons to believe this was\nnever meant for us.                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \n\nIt is not a message; it is a beacon. And it is leading someone here.                                                                                                                                                                                 '
  currentText: '******, we have made a mistake. I stayed after hours to finish an

